OL,3,GNEWSAWoman 'feels trapped' by scooter
OL,4,Aon bus test delay
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has said she feels trapped
OL,7,Ffollowing a delay in gaining permission
OL,8,Ffrom a bus firm to use a mobility
OL,9,Fscooter on board.
OL,11,FJennyfer Walker, from Willington in
OL,12,FCounty Durham, said she was told by
OL,13,FArriva on 14 September she required a
OL,14,Fpermit from the firm before she could
OL,15,Fboard the X46 bus with her mobility
OL,16,Fscooter.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
