OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F399A1791287796
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs1 wsj#57sj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWoman 'feels trapped' by scooter
OL,4,Aon bus test delay
OL,5,
OL,6,FTo obtain a permit, Walker was told she
OL,7,Fwould need to undergo a pre-booked test
OL,8,Fto prove she could safely board and
OL,9,Fdisembark with her scooter. She said
OL,10,FArriva initially told her it would be a
OL,11,F"long time" before that could take
OL,12,Fplace.
OL,14,FArriva has now said it has booked
OL,15,FWalker a test and the delay was due to
OL,16,Fstaffing issues.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
